# Compose engine pin — localsetup
#
# ALWAYS use `docker compose` for compose projects in this repo (litellm/,
# traefik/). NEVER `podman-compose`: podman-compose writes different network
# labels than docker compose and both engines fight over the same project
# network — see git log 2026-09-08 ("litellm: enable redis response cache").
#
# docker-compose.yml already sets the project network's name explicitly
# (litellm_default), which keeps the two engines from silently diverging, but
# running `podman-compose up` can still recreate/mislabel that network.

alias dc='docker compose'
